name datetime2-serbian
category Package
revision 52893
shortdesc Serbian language module for the datetime2 package
longdesc This module provides the "serbian" style that can be set using
longdesc \DTMsetstyle provided by datetime2.sty. It provides both
longdesc Cyrillic and Latin, Ekavian and Ijekavian variants of Serbian
longdesc date formats, regionalized and non-regionalized.
